// Package creator is used for quickly generating pages and content with a simple interface.
// It is built on top of the model package to provide access to the most common
// operations such as creating text and image reports and manipulating existing pages.
//
// # Template helpers
//
// Templates rendered with Creator.DrawTemplate can call the helpers below.
// Arithmetic helpers take their operands in expression order. Formatting,
// string and data helpers take the value they act on last, so it can be piped
// in: {{.total | formatNumber 2}}. Numeric arguments may be any integer or
// float type or a numeric string such as json.Number; arithmetic on two
// integers stays integral, div always returns a float. formatNumber and
// formatCurrency take optional thousands and decimal separators before the
// value, and round takes optional decimal places before it; both round halves
// away from zero. String times are parsed as RFC 3339 or "2006-01-02",
// optionally followed by a "15:04:05" time. A bad argument makes template
// execution fail with an error.
//
// Output of every action is XML-escaped unless TemplateOptions.DisableAutoEscape
// is set; while escaping is on, raw writes its argument verbatim. A
// TemplateOptions.HelperFuncMap entry with the name of a built-in helper
// replaces it, except raw while auto-escaping is on. An entry named pageNum,
// totalPages or chapter is used in the main template, and the page helper of
// that name is used inside <header> and <footer>.
//
//	Helper          Example                                                            Output
//	add             {{add 2 3}}                                                        5
//	sub             {{sub 10 3}}                                                       7
//	mul             {{mul 4 2.5}}                                                      10
//	div             {{div 7 2}}                                                        3.5
//	mod             {{mod 7 3}}                                                        1
//	round           {{round 2 3.14159}}                                                3.14
//	floor           {{floor 2.7}}                                                      2
//	ceil            {{ceil 2.1}}                                                       3
//	formatNumber    {{formatNumber 2 1234567.891}}                                     1,234,567.89
//	formatCurrency  {{formatCurrency "$" 2 -1234.5}}                                   -$1,234.50
//	formatPercent   {{formatPercent 1 0.256}}                                          25.6%
//	now             {{now | formatTime "2006-01-02"}}                                  e.g. 2026-11-10
//	formatTime      {{formatTime "Jan 2, 2006" "2024-03-15"}}                          Mar 15, 2024
//	parseTime       {{parseTime "02/01/2006" "15/03/2024" | formatTime "2006-01-02"}}  2024-03-15
//	addDate         {{addDate 0 1 0 "2024-01-15" | formatTime "2006-01-02"}}           2024-02-15
//	upper           {{upper "abc"}}                                                    ABC
//	lower           {{lower "ABC"}}                                                    abc
//	trim            {{trim " abc "}}                                                   abc
//	title           {{title "hello world"}}                                            Hello World
//	repeat          {{repeat 3 "ab"}}                                                  ababab
//	replace         {{replace "-" "/" "2024-03-15"}}                                   2024/03/15
//	join            {{join ", " (array "a" "b")}}                                      a, b
//	split           {{split "," "a,b,c"}}                                              [a b c]
//	truncate        {{truncate 5 "Hello world"}}                                       Hello
//	default         {{default "n/a" ""}}                                               n/a
//	hasKey          {{hasKey "a" (dict "a" 1)}}                                        true
//	contains        {{contains 2 (array 1 2 3)}}                                       true
//	first           {{first (array "a" "b")}}                                          a
//	last            {{last (array "a" "b")}}                                           b
//	isEven          {{isEven 4}}                                                       true
//	isOdd           {{isOdd 4}}                                                        false
//	ternary         {{ternary "yes" "no" true}}                                        yes
//	dict            {{(dict "a" 1).a}}                                                 1
//	array           {{index (array "x" "y") 1}}                                        y
//	extendDict      {{(extendDict (dict "a" 1) "b" 2).b}}                              2
